只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Distilly — Distill how they think into reusable Skills for any Agent or Bot. Formerly Colleague Skill（原同事 Skill）.","id":"gh:1195828337","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"distilly","slug":"titanwings/distilly","topics":["agent-skills","agentic-ai","ai-agent","ai-agents","ai-assistants","ai-persona","claude-code","claude-skills","codex","codex-skills","deepseek-harness","digital-human","dsh-plugin","hermes-agent","knowledge-distillation","llm-agent","meta-skill","openclaw","personal-agent"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Distilly — Distill how they think into reusable Skills for any Agent or Bot. Formerly Colleague Skil"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"still how they think into reusable Skills for any Agent or Bot. Formerly Colleague Skill（原同事 Skill）."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🧬 Distilly"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Formerly: Colleague Skill / colleague-skill.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"### Distill a person's experience, judgment, voice, and ways of working into a reusable Person Profi"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"le for AI agents and compatible bots."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Messages · documents · interviews · public sources → Distilly → Person Profile → Agent / Bot**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🧑‍💼  Your colleague quit, your mentor graduated, your teammate transferred — taking their whole play"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"book and context with them?"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"💞  Your family, old friends, partner drifting apart — and you want to hold on to the way it felt to "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"y, old friends, partner drifting apart — and you want to hold on to the way it felt to be with them?"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"🌟  Your favorite author, idol, thinker you'll never meet — but you want to know what they'd say abou"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" author, idol, thinker you'll never meet — but you want to know what they'd say about your question?"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### ✨ One project, many kinds of people."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Distilly is the person-modeling layer for agents. It turns the materials you provide into a portable"},{"id":"p10s2","text":", source-grounded Person Profile built from observable experience, decision patterns, expression, an"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"d ways of working; it does not claim to clone the person behind them."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Colleagues · partners · family · old friends · idols · public figures · fictional characters — even "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"es · partners · family · old friends · idols · public figures · fictional characters — even yourself"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Source material + your description → a source-grounded Person Profile → your Agent or compatible B"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"urce material + your description → a source-grounded Person Profile → your Agent or compatible Bot**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> A Person Profile is the reusable output. The current release packages each profile as an Agent Ski"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ll so supported hosts can install and invoke it. The canonical creator Skill is named `distilly`; in"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"stall it in a `distilly` directory. The former name above remains for search continuity and project "},{"id":"p13s4","text":" in a `distilly` directory. The former name above remains for search continuity and project history."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"🆕 What Distilly does · 📦 Data Sources · ⚡ Install · 🚀 Usage · ✨ Demo · 📝 Citation · 💬 Discord"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Chinese** · **Spanish** · **German** · **Japanese** · **Russian** · **Portuguese** · **Korean**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 🎉 2026.08.13 Milestone — **the project has passed 20K ⭐!**"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Massive thanks to everyone who starred — we'll keep shipping, keep distilling."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> 🧬 **2026.08.24 Update** — The creator is now named **Distilly** end to end and documents native lo"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"cal Skill discovery for Claude Code, Hermes, OpenClaw, Codex, DeepSeek Harness, Pi, Grok Build, and "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"OpenCode. Grok Bot is listed separately as a saved-Skill workflow preview."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> 📝 **2026.06.01 Update** — **The COLLEAGUE.SKILL technical report is now available**. The most rewa"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"rding part was not simply publishing a paper, but seeing the community grow the gallery to 215 skill"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"s contributed by 165 people, with more than 100,000 stars across the skill cards. The paper's Acknow"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ledgements explicitly recognize every community contributor."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> 🗺️ **2026.04.13** — **The Distilly Roadmap is live!** What began as Colleague Skill is growing bey"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ond colleagues: distill people into Skills that Agents can reuse. 👉 **Full Roadmap** · **💬 Discord**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> 🌐 **2026.04.07** — Community gallery is live! Any skill / meta-skill can drive traffic directly to"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" your own GitHub repo. No middleman. 👉 **titanwings.github.io/colleague-skill-site**"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Created by @titanwings"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 🆕 What Distilly does today"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### 1️⃣ From Colleague Skill to Distilly"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The project is no longer limited to the colleague scenario. Its `distilly` creator builds source-gro"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"unded Person Profiles for three person families with one workflow, then packages each profile as an "},{"id":"p25s3","text":" Profiles for three person families with one workflow, then packages each profile as an Agent Skill."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### 2️⃣ Three character families"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"🧑‍💼 colleague\n💞 relationship\n🌟 celebrity"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Coworkers · mentors · teammates · up/downstream partners\nExes · partners · parents · friends · close"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" family\nPublic figures · creators · public voices · fictional characters"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Builds a Work Skill + Persona from material-derived technical standards, workflows, expression, and "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"workplace behavior. Supports Lark / DingTalk / Slack collection.\nOrganizes material-derived expressi"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"on patterns, emotional triggers, conflict patterns, and repair patterns into a reusable Persona Skil"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"l.\nShips with a six-dimension research toolchain (subtitles → transcript cleanup → research merge → "},{"id":"p29s5","text":"quality check) for organizing observable decisions, expression, and mental models."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Each family has its own source-collection strategy, analysis dimensions, and Person Profile structur"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ch family has its own source-collection strategy, analysis dimensions, and Person Profile structure."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### 3️⃣ More Agent hosts"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The old version only ran in Claude Code. Distilly now supports native local Skill discovery across e"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"nly ran in Claude Code. Distilly now supports native local Skill discovery across eight agent hosts."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"**Grok Bot preview:** Grok Bot supports saved/private Skills, but its official docs do not describe "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"direct local `SKILL.md` imports. Distilly's workflow can be migrated manually into a saved Skill; di"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"rect repo installation is not yet verified."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Each generated Person Profile is packaged as an Agent Skill and can be installed into any supported "},{"id":"p34s2","text":"generated Person Profile is packaged as an Agent Skill and can be installed into any supported host."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## 🤖 Personal Agents"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Distilly also targets the personal agents people now live with. Each one keeps its own memory and co"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"nnected accounts, so a Person Profile is meant to carry over into them instead of starting from zero"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"nected accounts, so a Person Profile is meant to carry over into them instead of starting from zero."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Grok Bot\nsaved Skill · preview"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Meta Muse\nprofile handoff · planned"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"OpenAI Dots\nprofile handoff · planned"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"native Skill"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"native Skill"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## 🔧 Features"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
